member.remarks:
            Useful to cancel waits when a cancellation token is triggered.

Example:
            try
            {
                var tcs = new TaskCompletionSource<bool>();
                bool res = await tcs.WaitAsync(cancellationToken);
            }
            catch (OperationCanceledException)
            {
                // Exited via cancellation
            }

            See https://stackoverflow.com/a/35635651/852915
